  "_type": "issue",
  "id": "budget-zkts",
  "title": "Transfer matcher: bank/account-kind rules (cards only receive; checking->card only same bank; checking->checking only across banks)",
  "description": "User rule 2026-11-24. Applied by hand via MCP on prod: of 171 suggestions, 53 pairs fit the rules and were linked, 2 broke them (card outflow 'Dpen'; Itaú checking -> Nubank card 'PIX TRANSF SERGIO') and were dismissed. Existing 269 auto transfers already comply. Encode in api/src/budget/domain/transfer-matcher.ts: a card is never the outflow side of a transfer; checking -> card only when both accounts belong to the same institution (accounts.institution / connection institution; fall back to connection_id equality); checking -> checking only when institutions differ. Use the rule to break ties (chains like Itaú conta -> Nubank conta -> Nubank card same day) and to drop impossible candidates. Accounts without a known institution: keep current behaviour. Tests for each rule and the chain case.",
  "status": "closed",
  "priority": 1,
  "issue_type": "task",
