  "notes": "landed outside tk close at 318de4a (branch tk/budget-zkts merged into main by hand)\nImplemented on tk/budget-zkts (84aa070, based on origin/main 318de4a). shared 194 pass; api 1287 pass / 0 fail (BUDGET_REQUIRE_TEST_DB=1, compose :55432); client 1267 pass; tsc+eslint clean.\nMerged to local main (not pushed); owner approved in the Inbox thread 'Transfers refactor' on 2026-11-25. Matcher bank rules (card never pays; cash->card same bank; checking->checking across banks, checking only), refused pairs kept as suggestions with basis 'refused' and the rule, never auto-linked. Two independent reviews (review-zkts.md, review-zkts-2.md attached). Orchestrator reran on 5603daf: tsc shared/api/client clean, api eslint clean, shared 218, full api 1558 pass / 0 fail. Production accounts read 2026-11-24: one bank per connection, labels present.",
